{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026Zi26nxRFqD1794578107.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本核污染水排放總量超過了19萬噸。</p><p></p><p>日本東京電力公司周五公布，福島第一核電站第25輪核污染水排海當天結束，這輪排放由上月26日開始，總共排放7,800多噸，含放射性氚總量約1.4萬億貝克勒爾。</p><p></p><p>2023年8月，日方無視國際社會強烈質疑和反對，單方面強行啟動福島第一核電站核污染水排海，至今總共排放達19.6萬噸。</p><p></p><p>東電發布的數據顯示，截至上月底，福島第一核電站內儲水罐還有大約122萬噸核污染水。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:43:18.404081+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":199,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T12:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T08:15:24.386840+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T14:36:19.831155+00:00","content_hash":"36083cbbf17eb7402420413773b0998e66f2227140b367bee1b5a4deb794731b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T14:43:18.404081+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}